{
  "_readme": [
    "Jetify – adjustable variables. Edit this file to change slider spans; reload the page (no code changes needed).",
    "Per entry: key = internal name (do not change), label = text shown, unit, kind = slider | number,",
    "min / max = slider span, step = slider/input increment, digits = decimals shown.",
    "max may also be the key of another variable (e.g. \"hullLength_m\") – the span then follows that value.",
    "percent: true = stored as a fraction (0.1) but shown as % (10 %). nullable: true = may be left blank (auto).",
    "Default VALUES are not set here: vehicle values come from vehicles.json, environment/turbulence defaults from model.json.",
    "cruiseSpeed_mps min/max also sets the speed range scanned for best range and max speed."
  ],
